<speak>That's helpful. Let me explain the first document I have open. My consolidated portfolio summary shows a total balance of 1,200,000 American dollars. That is background on my overall position, not the amount of this sale. I keep that summary for orientation, but it isn't intended to replace the underlying statements. The awkward part is that the summary looks very polished, so I can catch myself treating it as though it were the primary record.</speak>